==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features {{p|Basculin}} in its {{form|Basculin|Red-Striped Form}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Black & White|Basculin|35}} from the {{TCG|Black & White}} expansion.
*'''Surprise Strike''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Phantom Forces|Yanmega|4}} from the {{TCG|Phantom Forces}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

